* CABSRT08 - SELECT OUT-OF-BALANCE CONTROL RECORDS
* MVT SORT/MERGE CONTROL CARD.  SORTS THE DAY'S CTLOUT
* GENERATIONS BY PROGRAM-ID AND RUN-ID FOR CABCTLRP, WHICH
* BUILDS THE RECONCILIATION EXCEPTION REPORT AND PRINTS IN THAT
* ORDER.  A CLEAN DAY PRODUCES ZERO OUTPUT RECORDS HERE.
*
* THE SELECTION HAS LEFT THIS CARD.  ONLY CONTROL RECORDS THAT
* DID NOT BALANCE ARE KEPT, AND THAT TEST IS NOW HELD IN THE E15
* EXIT CABSXBAL.  THE CARD TESTED THE SINGLE BYTE AT COLUMN 40
* FOR NOT 'B'.  THE EXIT TESTS THE NAMED CT-BAL-IND FIELD AND
* ITS CONDITION NAMES.  THAT IS A WIDENING OF THE TEST AND NOT A
* NARROWING - EVERY RECORD THE CARD KEPT IS STILL KEPT.  THE
* EXIT ALSO COUNTS THE RECORDS BY CT-RC BAND AND WRITES THE
* PROFILE TO THE MESSAGE DATA SET.
*
* EQUAL KEY HANDLING IS NOT CODED.  A PROCESS THAT WRITES MORE
* THAN ONE CONTROL RECORD IN A RUN PRESENTS EQUAL KEYS HERE, AND
* THE EXCEPTION REPORT DOES NOT DEPEND ON THE ORDER WITHIN AN
* EQUAL KEY, SO NO EXIT HAS TO GUARANTEE IT.
*
* THE SELECTION RULE IS NO LONGER READABLE FROM THIS CARD.
 SORT FIELDS=(9,8,CH,A,50,2,CH,A)
 RECORD TYPE=F,LENGTH=(180)
 MODS E15=(CABSXBAL,4096,SORTEXIT,N)
 END
